VALUES ('YKtm-6ehxG8','Coming home to Mongolia | DW English','When Saruul Fischer came to East Germany from Mongolia at the age of eleven, she could not have known how important her homeland would be to her in the future. She stayed there after the fall of the Berlin Wall, went to university, married and had children. Struck by a yearning for her homeland, she began developing an idea for the fashion label "Edelziege”. More Documentaries and Reports on: http://www.dw.de/program/documentaries-and-reports/s-3610-9798','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YKtm-6ehxG8/maxresdefault.jpg','Documentaries','DW Documentary','DW Documentary','UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q','DOCUMENTARY','2014-12-22T20:19:54Z','','','{"id":"YKtm-6ehxG8","title":"Coming home to Mongolia | DW English","description":"When Saruul Fischer came to East Germany from Mongolia at the age of eleven, she could not have known how important her homeland would be to her in the future. She stayed there after the fall of the Berlin Wall, went to university, married and had children. Struck by a yearning for her homeland, she began developing an idea for the fashion label \"Edelziege”. More Documentaries and Reports on: http://www.dw.de/program/documentaries-and-reports/s-3610-9798","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YKtm-6ehxG8/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Documentaries","city":"","country":"","channel":"DW Documentary","channelTitle":"DW Documentary","channelId":"UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q","badge":"DOCUMENTARY","publishedAt":"2014-12-22T20:19:54Z","viewCount":726777,"durationSeconds":2553,"admission":{"version":3,"status":"channel-candidate","source":"channel-archive","mode":"DOCUMENTARIES"}}',1);
