VALUES ('IralqVXQw8U','By train along the fjord coast of Norway | DW Documentary','Northern Norway in June: Fjords and mountains bathed in the light of the midnight sun. The Norwegian Nordland Railway runs from Trondheim along fjords and rivers, up to the Arctic Circle, via Saltfjellet with the Svartisen glacier to Bodø. On beautiful June days, the fjord coasts of northern Norway reveal themselves in the breathtaking light of the midnight sun. The Nordland Railway crosses the bright night even in rough Nordic weather and winds its way along the banks of fjords and rivers up to the Arctic Circle. It crosses the barren Saltfjellet plateau with the Svartisen glacier to reach Saltstraumen, Norway''s strongest tidal stream, just in time for the Midsummer Festival. Along the train route from Trondheim to Bodø, the Vikings fought, the Nazis built spectacular bridges and tunnels and the Sami, the indigenous people of northern Scandinavia, still breed reindeer today. A water-rich, wild landscape that draws world-class canoeists and ambitious painters -- and a place where countless moose and the rare Arctic fox live. #documentary #dwdocumentary #dwdocs #train #norway ______ DW Documentary gives you knowledge beyond the headlines. Watch top documentaries from German broadcasters and international production companies. Meet intriguing people, travel to distant lands, get a look behind the complexities of daily life and build a deeper understanding of current affairs and global events. Subscribe and explore the world around you with DW Documentary. Subscribe to: ‬ ⮞ DW Documentary (English): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumentary ⮞ DW Documental (Spanish): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumental ⮞ DW Documentary وثائقية دي دبليو (Arabic): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocarabia ⮞ DW Documentary हिन्दी (Hindi): https://www.youtube.com/dwdochindi ⮞ DW Doku (German): https://www.youtube.com/dwdoku For more visit: http://www.dw.com/en/tv/docfilm/s-3610 Follow DW Documentary on Instagram: ht